   "source": [
    "DATA = PROJECT / 'data/ldo'\n",
    "if RUN_NATIVE:\n",
    "    from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
    "    output = PROJECT / 'work' / datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime('ldo_%Y%m%d_%H%M%S')\n",
    "    lab.regenerate(output, cases=lab.manifest()['all_cases'],\n",
    "                   include_characteristics=True, terminal_extraction=False)\n",
    "    DATA = output\n",
    "\n",
    "record = lab.manifest(DATA)\n",
    "check = lab.verify_saved_data(DATA)\n",
    "print(record['simulator'])\n",
    "print('Complete transistor regulator data verified')\n",
    "nominal = lab.dc_summary(DATA)\n",
    "capacitors = lab.capacitor_summary(DATA)\n",
    "corners = lab.corner_summary(DATA)\n",
    "CASE = 'tied_load50mA_cout100pF'\n",
    "display(nominal[['load_mA', 'output_V', 'gate_V', 'VAA_current_uA', 'standing_current_uA']]\n",
    "        .rename(columns={'load_mA':'Load (mA)', 'output_V':'Output (V)', 'gate_V':'Gate (V)',\n",
    "                         'VAA_current_uA':'VAA current (µA)', 'standing_current_uA':'Total standing current (µA)'})\n",
    "        .round(6))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f19745166c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The total standing current is $I_{\\mathrm{VIN}}+I_{\\mathrm{VAA}}-I_L$. It includes\n",
    "the output bleeder. Because the circuit uses two supply voltages, efficiency must\n",
    "be calculated from power, rather than from output current divided by input current:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\eta=\\frac{V_oI_L}{V_{\\mathrm{IN}}I_{\\mathrm{VIN}}+V_{AA}I_{\\mathrm{VAA}}}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The ideal reference drives transistor gates and supplies negligible DC current in\n",
    "this model. The following table identifies every transistor by its connected\n",
    "drain, gate, source, and body. Width is per unit and multiplicity gives the unit count.\n"
   ]
  },
