  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d1bda1e020",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "These operating points also provide a check on the hand model. The following\n",
    "calculation uses the measured transistor parameters and the connected finite BU\n",
    "impedance. It compares the calculated DC precision gain with the native voltage\n",
    "injection result. Agreement at DC does not remove the internal poles omitted from\n",
    "the hand equations.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "b9d2c33345",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
       "<style scoped>\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n",
