    "contribute no generator noise. Their real noise would reach VOUT through the\n",
    "separately measured reference and supply transfers.\n",
    "\n",
    "The output noise integrated from 10 Hz to 100 MHz is approximately 140 µV rms\n",
    "at zero load and 171 µV rms at 50 mA. Noise integration bandwidth is stated\n",
    "explicitly because the total changes substantially with the selected band.\n"
   ]
  },
